WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.135
Guide 1. Find a cell. Watch how I find a
cell.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:06.745
Then you try it yourself. I'm looking for
B2.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:12.215
I'll start with the letter B at the top of
the table. That tells me which

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.455
column to follow down. Now I'll find row 2
using the numbers on the left.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:23.255
Where column B and row 2 meet, I've found
B2. Look at the number inside it.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:29.715
It says 30. What does that 30 mean? I'll
read the label on the same row:

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:36.515
Reusable cups. So B2 tells us that the plan
includes 30 reusable cups.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.555
Remember: letter first, number second.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:46.530
Now it's your turn. Return to the lesson
card, read the cell address it asks for and
find that cell.
